<title>FRANCE: Bollore family holds 2/3 of voting rights.</title>
<headline>Bollore family holds 2/3 of voting rights.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Groups representing the Bollore family breached the threshold of two thirds of voting rights in conglomerate Bollore Technologies, the SBF French stock markets association said on Friday.</p>
<p>The family now owns 4,608,962 voting rights, which is 66.78 percent of the total.</p>
